  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/847068.svg\" alt=\"title\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>“Vanilla Expansion Collection”<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/vanilla-expansion\" rel=\"nofollow\">模组包</a>的模块</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>描述：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">围绕玩家交互进行的调整</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>已实现的功能：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">方块破坏阶段</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; - 更改为更直观的纹理（见截图）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">附魔金苹果</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; - 将纹理更改为“钻石金苹果”</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>计划中的功能：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">菜单/物品栏更新？（将所有 GUI 改为深色模式）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
